[{"title":"送苏惟和宰贵溪","author":"符锡","text":"百里基元化，孰惟师帅贤。\n故人豫章宰，两见动星躔。\n农雨三春足，弦歌四邑传。\n为民甘政拙，许国自心坚。\n戎马方忧杞，仙凫适去燕。\n五云何渤郁，快睹孝廉船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43848,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王武选子中奉使南还","author":"符锡","text":"流飙击芳树，郊气爽然新。\n立马缘回久，驱车怅望频。\n素襟还昨日，文采见兹晨。\n锦怅爰分席，星槎岂问津。\n故园便使节，归雁数秋旻。\n未必能留恋，丹心切紫宸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43849,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送游静之二尹无","author":"符锡","text":"乡邑知名士，寒松操愈坚。\n晋陵看发轫，赞府试烹鲜。\n柳色沿溪涨，椐阴夹道平。\n典刑遗老在，文物故家传。\n化及争先赋，庭馀示辱鞭。\n何当对披豁，重软惠山泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43850,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽鹅湖阁老","author":"符锡","text":"辅德人惟旧，徵书帝自裁。\n紫霄终日待，黄阁应时开。\n讵拟中台折，俄惊国柱摧。\n大川方据楫，商鼎适调梅。\n长逝民安仰，重光业未恢。\n位隆兼恤典，名重盖伦魁。\n圣眷应无替，仙游竟不回。\n典刑斯巳矣，芳誉实悠哉。\n旌望家乘远，皇猷国史该。\n三朝遗泽在，穹碣贲泉台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43851,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谏议后屏卢子奉仗楚粤便道归觐三十韵","author":"符锡","text":"国家承平久，边庾不复实。\n九重甫垂念，诏使七道出。\n故人后屏子，喜气动行色。\n所适问刖期，南楚与百粤。\n君始发危科，怀忧在衮职。\n兹行雅所如，弭节照乡邑。\n鹭袍拜家庆，世德光奕奕。\n白发笼乌纱，鸾封侈先入。\n携盒廑父老，举杯多亲戚。\n高堂届眉寿，欢宴难具述。\n秋风吹征袍，王事不遑息。\n晓发湓江浦，夕望夏口驿。\n翱翔冈高楼，徘徊吕仙奕。\n西登祝融峰，俯瞰洞庭碧。\n九疑云正深，二妃安所适。\n夷俗杂夏殊，吏治究文一。\n周爰宜有献，再当言路辟。\n往事多激成，圣情每念及。\n昌运际实难，中兴待良弼。\n豫养本静深，才华更荒蔚。\n天骥就康庄，谁能顾俦匹。\n嗟我朽钝资，尝从礼官役。\n情好如弟兄，论事埘促膝。\n赠言非所长，况乃厌陈迹。\n刍荛倘见录，庶以输寸赤。\n银河泛本使，悬象动宸极。\n近侍难久违，还当颛谏席。\n功名尽麒麟，富贵焉所逼。\n伟哉廉蔺交，千载不可易。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43852,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面","author":"符锡","text":"月过芭蕉夜许深，参同还向手中寻。\n东溟误把长竿弄，愧尽平生此老心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发石桥，问程当宿丽阳。偶值故人，论诗马上，不觉越关，从者为之绝倒","author":"符锡","text":"石桥上马蹴微霜，指点儿曹宿丽阳。\n村店过来犹未觉，小童应笑论诗忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43854,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏柬刘梅国 其一","author":"符锡","text":"只道文章可致身，十年随俗走红尘。\n如今欲返图南驾，却笑真成两截人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43855,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏柬刘梅国 其二","author":"符锡","text":"腊尽春回北上期，联鞯谈笑竟忘疲。\n两三烟柳十家市，到却丽阳殊未知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43856,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与秦节之题扇","author":"符锡","text":"蟾宫扃禁几重深，故识云踪更远寻。\n隐约看图犹似梦，可应还动少年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43857,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹","author":"符锡","text":"谁家竹子满江浔，排槛穿沙饶十寻。\n我欲裁之双玉笛，风生万壑尽龙吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43858,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发钱塘","author":"符锡","text":"钱粤城头彭四更，棹郎依约放舟行。\n梦回羌笛歌声小，山月半窗潮欲平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43859,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑苏留别子公","author":"符锡","text":"欲别未别吴山前，预作相思萦昼眠。\n笑引西蒙问东海，不知谁是懒中仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43860,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿杨村访平泉大史先书一绝","author":"符锡","text":"天际轻云散午阴，乳莺啼树正春深。\n无端一夜江村雨，半落孤舟客子心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43861,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与费亨父游山因出妇翁介庵阁老扇面求和","author":"符锡","text":"华国文章柱世才，相君宗伯两还该。\n时人谩道东床好，自信风流有许来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43862,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面为谢都转赋","author":"符锡","text":"远水浮烟翠蔼重，秦淮山色有无中。\n莫教林外来车马，老子看山意正浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43863,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅坡卷 其一","author":"符锡","text":"抚卷看梅二月时，一般清气可诗脾。\n山居未问春深浅，秪道年芳他自迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43864,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅坡卷 其二","author":"符锡","text":"十里山亭一径回，小梅无恙绕亭开。\n巡檐猛可闻双喜，疑有探花人到来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43865,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双衬南归","author":"符锡","text":"扶臤双归锦水棺，旅魂聊慰首丘安。\n谁家门外松楸好，犹暴荒原夜雨寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43866,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与李景咏夜话","author":"符锡","text":"东湖湖上坐清风，月涌银河落镜中。\n四海论心如此夕，不知倾盖几人同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43867,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬南厓","author":"符锡","text":"小颖江头归兴浓，纷披秋雨乱芙蓉。\n湖东一夜相思梦，都属南厓药裹中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43868,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访双溪友人","author":"符锡","text":"县城南去接双溪，龙墅迢迢路不迷。\n满架图书邀客过，长春花底坐莺啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43869,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春宿金城兰若 其一","author":"符锡","text":"战垒何年柱斧歼，青枫江上老耕钤。\n我来閒访前朝寺，香火重开话建炎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43870,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春宿金城兰若 其二","author":"符锡","text":"为怕春归特地来，揽衣随意坐莓苔。\n东风似与花先约，贪看猩红映日开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43871,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晏生人胜人操春日从予南冈及夏而还寄此作","author":"符锡","text":"新松泱莽护寒塘，断雁时依病鹤藏。\n未向空林怨萧瑟，西风吹起自成行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43872,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"饮钮司训初冬雪霁芭蕉亭然可掬主人因请在席各赋一绝","author":"符锡","text":"雪晴江馆一尊开，翠扫浓蕉溢户来。\n疑是广□官独冷，阳和偏许隔年回。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43873,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"便面送舍弟蜀游","author":"符锡","text":"去年忆我燕山北，此日送君西蜀游。\n便与□鸿带书道，小塘新隐荻花秋。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43874,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樱桃","author":"符锡","text":"猛可东风度小池，朱樱开得两三枝。\n好似撷□溪畔女，凝妆临水照多时。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43875,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芍药 其一","author":"符锡","text":"芍药花开能可怜，金丝蹙蕊粉围边。\n几时王四堂前是，惆怅岩姿又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43876,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芍药 其二","author":"符锡","text":"芍药花开对小堂，似□儿女学新妆。\n丛丛相映犹堪惜，况复一枝无并芳。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43877,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"问萱花","author":"符锡","text":"紫萱开彻满吟窝，间菊穿篱映浅莎。\n见说穷愁君解释，还能销得鬓丝么。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43878,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代萱花答","author":"符锡","text":"山花随意度山城，何处忘忧浪得名。\n却笑息心尘外客，也凭鸡卜问阴晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43879,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静观徐先生挽卷","author":"符锡","text":"两傅名藩事巳非，府中懿范见应稀。\n金枝重系兰苕在，风雨龙丘有□归。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43880,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈通府元宪擢白盐井提举","author":"符锡","text":"牂牁南去剑峰攒，云净秋空立马看。\n盐铁且拚今日醉，天涯回首是长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43881,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜峰","author":"符锡","text":"杜峰别来今几秋，清诗写入小堂幽。\n但得主人常对酒，不知何处是并州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43882,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱宣政双慕卷","author":"符锡","text":"有客频频款我扉，泪痕斑尽旧莱衣。\n回首江云三尺土，短诗谁写寸心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43883,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹轩","author":"符锡","text":"隐翁幽德何所属，家傍清江仍小筑。\n枕上春宵风雨声，自启疏棂数新竹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43884,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬龙道亨进士","author":"符锡","text":"风光全著日边杏，春意故愆江上梅。\n气味不殊登荐异，谩怀金鼎罄涓埃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43885,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白水思亲卷","author":"符锡","text":"白水知何注思深，谩劳词客费追寻。\n千秋慈母坟前月，影落寒潭照汝心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43886,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小葵 其一","author":"符锡","text":"小葵花老因繁实，应手剪之花复然。\n翻笑五男多实在，不求花好事人怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43887,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小葵 其二","author":"符锡","text":"谩说支离多逸兴，小葵高槛日能来。\n风光霁景应无限，湿雨凉云他自开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43888,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小葵 其三","author":"符锡","text":"庭下短葵卑结子，丈葵高自倚芳英。\n高卑于汝吾何有，