","text":"江浦杏花开树树，春光抖擞野人家。\n恼澈樵渔无处觅，误疑玄圃窅春沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43901,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸溪周元公书院 其一","author":"符锡","text":"绝学千秋梦始醒，藻频何处荐舂陵。\n那知山市潢污里，别有春风一径庭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43902,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸溪周元公书院 其二","author":"符锡","text":"濂溪何自来监税，环堵遗斋尚揭名。\n抱道热中吾浅测，官资元不病先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43903,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泸溪周元公书院 其三","author":"符锡","text":"憧憧行子青衫湿，风雨濂溪又过门。\n道化未能三百里，溪桥祠屋愧空存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43904,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘东","author":"符锡","text":"□山江口湘东市，雨雨风风几度过。\n今日蔽裘重入楚，酒帘将柰客愁何。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43905,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武陵即事","author":"符锡","text":"源上桃花逐去津，客心方怯暮江春。\n谁家思妇浓妆在，正倚江楼望远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43906,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江月二绝 其一","author":"符锡","text":"别我家山月盛时，看看明发又轮西。\n江天只似开明镜，迢递随人到五溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43907,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江月二绝 其二","author":"符锡","text":"武陵三月风景暮，景暮客愁难强谐。\n殷勤却愧青霄月，蓦地穿窗下客怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43908,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"桃源","author":"符锡","text":"倦客西游何所之，桃花流水武溪湄。\n秦人欲问无踪迹，争似渔郎再到时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43909,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"穿石 其一","author":"符锡","text":"海风吹折巨鳌簪，一孔横波贯百寻。\n禽著蛟龙莫挥剑，好施铁缆系江心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43910,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"穿石 其二","author":"符锡","text":"千寻窦石知谁凿，岑立江波何壮哉。\n舟人渔子争传说，宛见将军避暑来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43911,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨述怀","author":"符锡","text":"楚山千里望辰州，一月蓬窗不裹头。\n借问客怀诗卷里，几多风雨几多愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43912,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与僧题梅","author":"符锡","text":"道山梅树缘谁写，墨妙分明夺化亚。\n蜂蝶未知真假在，回回他自领春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43913,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖中绝句 其一","author":"符锡","text":"洞庭湖西秋水平，赤山又入半湖明。\n楚天雷雨忽四际，漫倚疏蓬看晚晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43914,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖中绝句 其二","author":"符锡","text":"秋色平湖澹碧漪，绕船菱荇客归迟。\n无人话与王摩诘，羸得先生画里诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43915,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长沙寻访友人不见","author":"符锡","text":"不挂羊裘系短蓬，烟波何处觅行踪。\n湘山湘水应无际，君在白云知几重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43916,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伏波庙","author":"符锡","text":"炎烬重嘘可自由，伏波祠庙楚江秋。\n英雄去就不早计，谁与勋名万古留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43917,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醴陵柬施可大","author":"符锡","text":"醴水西边一故人，十年江海倍情亲。\n渔舟却笑东归客，不避风尘来问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43918,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠彭敬之四绝 其一","author":"符锡","text":"白梅既往东洲少，太守文章旧有名。\n百年家庆□遗稿，前辈风流尚典刑。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43919,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠彭敬之四绝 其二","author":"符锡","text":"乘时孰敢轻儒将，一剑西风扫断云。\n幕下掌书凡几辈，摅忠却道不如君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":43920,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]